    "6": "Because we have completed all previous steps (Pour-Pour three little puddles straight from the blender into the frying pan),  we can now do the step Cook-Cook for 1 min or until the tops start to bubble. And now we have completed this step Cook-Cook for 1 min or until the tops start to bubble.",
    "7": "Because we have completed all previous steps (Add-Add 1 banana to a blender, and Add-1 heaped tbsp flour to a blender, and Add-1/2 tsp baking powder to a blender, and Add-1 egg to a blender),  we can now do the step blitz-blitz the blender for 20 seconds. And now we have completed this step blitz-blitz the blender for 20 seconds.",
    "8": "Because we have completed all previous steps (Cook-Cook for 1 min or until the tops start to bubble),  we can now do the step Flip-Flip the pancakes with a fork or a fish slice spatula. And now we have completed this step Flip-Flip the pancakes with a fork or a fish slice spatula.",
    "9": "Because we have completed all previous steps (START), and have all necessary ingredients (egg), we can now do the step Add-1 egg to a blender. And now we have completed this step Add-1 egg to a blender.",
    "10": "Because we have completed all previous steps (Flip-Flip the pancakes with a fork or a fish slice spatula),  we can now do the step cook-cook for 20-30 seconds more. And now we have completed this step cook-cook for 20-30 seconds more.",
    "11": "Because we have completed all previous steps (Melt-Melt a small knob of butter in a non-stick frying pan over low-medium heat),  we can now do the step Pour-Pour three little puddles straight from the blender into the frying pan. And now we have completed this step Pour-Pour three little puddles straight from the blender into the frying pan.",
    "12": "Because we have completed all previous steps (START), and have all necessary ingredients (flour), we can now do the step Add-1 heaped tbsp flour to a blender. And now we have completed this step Add-1 heaped tbsp flour to a blender.",
    "13": "Because we have completed all previous steps (START), and have all necessary ingredients (strawberry), we can now do the step Chop-Chop 1 strawberry. And now we have completed this step Chop-Chop 1 strawberry.",
